Privacy Policy

Last updated: September 2026

1. Overview

This Privacy Policy describes how information is handled in the QuestVentures mobile application (the "App"). We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting it.

2. Information Collection and Use

The App does not collect, store, transmit, or share any personal information or personally identifiable information (PII). All quest scripts, gameplay progression, and interactions occur entirely locally on your device.

3. Local Device Storage

The App only saves minimal technical preferences locally on your device (such as your chosen language and confirmation that the Safety Disclaimer has been accepted). This data remains strictly on your device, is never uploaded to any external servers, and is never shared with third parties.

4. Third-Party Services and Analytics

The App does not use third-party tracking tools, analytics SDKs (such as Firebase Analytics or Google Analytics), or advertising networks.

5. Children's Privacy

Because the App collects no personal information whatsoever, we do not knowingly collect, solicit, or maintain data from children under any jurisdiction, complying with standards such as COPPA and GDPR.

6. Changes to This Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted directly within this document with an updated revision date.

